    "name": "Jeweler Simulator: Prologue",
    "steam_appid": 2948930,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948930/extras/062ffb1d513141b9856c15e14c88c25b.poster.avif?t=1745566098\" width=800 height=318 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948930/extras/062ffb1d513141b9856c15e14c88c25b.webm?t=1745566098\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948930/extras/062ffb1d513141b9856c15e14c88c25b.mp4?t=1745566098\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jeweler Simulator: Prologue offers a more limited experience than the full version. It is a completely free version with fun mechanics where you can buy and sell products by managing a jewelry store and grow your business with the profits you earn. Prologue version includes silver and gold items. <br><br>Jeweler Simulator: Prologue is full of customers who want to sell you their rings and necklaces. Test and evaluate the authenticity of products. <br><br>As you engage in buying and selling, keeping your store clean, you earn the opportunity to improve your skills, becoming a better jeweler with each passing day. <br><br>Purchase more luxurious furniture, master your profession, and raise your prestige. Let people be dazzled by your brilliance!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948930/extras/7ad85e2855981c07a5052510a39ed7fc.webp?t=1745566098\" width=598 height=3 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948930/extras/b2f1cc8a3538adc4c776ddee387bcacb.poster.avif?t=1745566098\" width=800 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948930/extras/b2f1cc8a3538adc4c776ddee387bcacb.webm?t=1745566098\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948930/extras/b2f1cc8a3538adc4c776ddee387bcacb.mp4?t=1745566098\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948930/extras/a5cd1b8e8ef67f523a27efb1cb228d70.poster.avif?t=1745566098\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948930/extras/a5cd1b8e8ef67f523a27efb1cb228d70.webm?t=1745566098\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948930/extras/a5cd1b8e8ef67f523a27efb1cb228d70.mp4?t=1745566098\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before buying a product, it\u2019s important to check if it\u2019s real. You should look for damage on metals and see how they react to magnets. For stones, you need to check their color, clarity, carat, and cut carefully. Different mini-games will help you do these tests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948930/extras/ea12b23b465ae637e6b610594075b787.poster.avif?t=1745566098\" width=800 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948930/extras/ea12b23b465ae637e6b610594075b787.webm?t=1745566098\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948930/extras/ea12b23b465ae637e6b610594075b787.mp4?t=1745566098\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948930/extras/f97ce7b5bec7cf89a8ad6a626a424ce9.poster.avif?t=1745566098\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948930/extras/f97ce7b5bec7cf89a8ad6a626a424ce9.webm?t=1745566098\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948930/extras/f97ce7b5bec7cf89a8ad6a626a424ce9.mp4?t=1745566098\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can bargain with customers who want to sell you something or buy from you. There is also a variety of dialogues, so you can have different conversations with each customer. Some of these conversations are wicked.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948930/extras/84e5bcdabe7406bd486a7af4d9c84b90.poster.avif?t=1745566098\" width=800 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948930/extras/84e5bcdabe7406bd486a7af4d9c84b90.webm?t=1745566098\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948930/extras/84e5bcdabe7406bd486a7af4d9c84b90.mp4?t=1745566098\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948930/extras/b357dab17a87e470dbae2a3097b026e2.poster.avif?t=1745566098\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948930/extras/b357dab17a87e470dbae2a3097b026e2.webm?t=1745566098\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948930/extras/b357dab17a87e470dbae2a3097b026e2.mp4?t=1745566098\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With cool display cases, nice counters, and useful storage, you can make your shop look better. You can place the furniture how you like and store more items to sell at the same time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948930/extras/7ad85e2855981c07a5052510a39ed7fc.webp?t=1745566098\" width=598 height=3 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948930/extras/062ffb1d513141b9856c15e14c88c25b.poster.avif?t=1745566098\" width=800 height=318 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948930/extras/062ffb1d513141b9856c15e14c88c25b.webm?t=1745566098\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948930/extras/062ffb1d513141b9856c15e14c88c25b.mp4?t=1745566098\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jeweler Simulator: Prologue offers a more limited experience than the full version. It is a completely free version with fun mechanics where you can buy and sell products by managing a jewelry store and grow your business with the profits you earn. Prologue version includes silver and gold items. <br><br>Jeweler Simulator: Prologue is full of customers who want to sell you their rings and necklaces. Test and evaluate the authenticity of products. <br><br>As you engage in buying and selling, keeping your store clean, you earn the opportunity to improve your skills, becoming a better jeweler with each passing day. <br><br>Purchase more luxurious furniture, master your profession, and raise your prestige. Let people be dazzled by your brilliance!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948930/extras/7ad85e2855981c07a5052510a39ed7fc.webp?t=1745566098\" width=598 height=3 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948930/extras/b2f1cc8a3538adc4c776ddee387bcacb.poster.avif?t=1745566098\" width=800 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948930/extras/b2f1cc8a3538adc4c776ddee387bcacb.webm?t=1745566098\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948930/extras/b2f1cc8a3538adc4c776ddee387bcacb.mp4?t=1745566098\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948930/extras/a5cd1b8e8ef67f523a27efb1cb228d70.poster.avif?t=1745566098\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948930/extras/a5cd1b8e8ef67f523a27efb1cb228d70.webm?t=1745566098\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948930/extras/a5cd1b8e8ef67f523a27efb1cb228d70.mp4?t=1745566098\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before buying a product, it\u2019s important to check if it\u2019s real. You should look for damage on metals and see how they react to magnets. For stones, you need to check their color, clarity, carat, and cut carefully. Different mini-games will help you do these tests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948930/extras/ea12b23b465ae637e6b610594075b787.poster.avif?t=1745566098\" width=800 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948930/extras/ea12b23b465ae637e6b610594075b787.webm?t=1745566098\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948930/extras/ea12b23b465ae637e6b610594075b787.mp4?t=1745566098\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948930/extras/f97ce7b5bec7cf89a8ad6a626a424ce9.poster.avif?t=1745566098\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948930/extras/f97ce7b5bec7cf89a8ad6a626a424ce9.webm?t=1745566098\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948930/extras/f97ce7b5bec7cf89a8ad6a626a424ce9.mp4?t=1745566098\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can bargain with customers who want to sell you something or buy from you. There is also a variety of dialogues, so you can have different conversations with each customer. Some of these conversations are wicked.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948930/extras/84e5bcdabe7406bd486a7af4d9c84b90.poster.avif?t=1745566098\" width=800 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948930/extras/84e5bcdabe7406bd486a7af4d9c84b90.webm?t=1745566098\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948930/extras/84e5bcdabe7406bd486a7af4d9c84b90.mp4?t=1745566098\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948930/extras/b357dab17a87e470dbae2a3097b026e2.poster.avif?t=1745566098\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948930/extras/b357dab17a87e470dbae2a3097b026e2.webm?t=1745566098\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948930/extras/b357dab17a87e470dbae2a3097b026e2.mp4?t=1745566098\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With cool display cases, nice counters, and useful storage, you can make your shop look better. You can place the furniture how you like and store more items to sell at the same time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948930/extras/7ad85e2855981c07a5052510a39ed7fc.webp?t=1745566098\" width=598 height=3 /></span></p>",
